[rdfs11: (?c <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> ?d) (?d <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> ?e) -> (?c <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> ?e)]
